BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>Resting afloat</h1>
In the default sea (a metre of swell): a delta-glider set down on the water
by the scenario starts afloat; another let go above the water comes to rest
afloat. Both ride out an hour at 100x and 1000x time acceleration, and the
engines take one away again.
END_HYPERDESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 51982.6685767396
  Script Tests/WaterWarpTest
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship SET
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET SET
  MODE Extern
  POS 4 0 -20
  TRACKMODE TargetRelative
  FOV 50.00
END_CAMERA

BEGIN_SHIPS
SET:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Landed Earth
  POS -70.0000 28.0000
  HEADING 90.00
  GEAR 0 0.0000
  PRPLEVEL 0:0.300 1:1.000
END
DROP:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Landed Earth
  POS -70.0000 28.0100
  HEADING 0.00
  GEAR 0 0.0000
  PRPLEVEL 0:0.300 1:1.000
END
END_SHIPS
